# Frontend env for Solana RPC.
# Leave UNSET to use the backend's same-origin RPC proxy (/api/rpc) which holds
# the configured RPC (NETWORK + optional BACKEND_SOLANA_RPC) server-side.
# Public RPCs (api.mainnet-beta.solana.com) return 403 to browser origins.
#
# ONLY set VITE_SOLANA_RPC if you have a public key you are happy to expose:
# VITE_SOLANA_RPC=https://mainnet.helius-rpc.com/?api-key=YOUR_KEY